menu "AI Passport BSP"

config AI_PASSPORT_QEMU
    bool "Use the QEMU virtual RGB panel"
    default n
    help
        Build the same application for Espressif's ESP32-C3 QEMU target.
        This swaps only the physical ST7789P3 transport for QEMU's MMIO-backed
        RGB panel. It must never be enabled for a physical AI Passport.

endmenu
